{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22496","headline":"生离别 · 白居易","name":"生离别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"食檗不易食梅难，檗能苦兮梅能酸。\n未如生别之爲难，苦在心兮酸在肝。\n晨鸡再鸣残月没，征马连嘶行人出。\n回看骨肉哭一声，梅酸檗苦甘如蜜。\n黄河水白黄云秋，行人河边相对愁。\n天寒野旷何处宿？棠棃叶战风飕飕。\n生离别，生离别，忧从中来无断绝。\n忧极心劳血气衰，未年三十生白发。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}